cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this software, please cite it as below."
title: "BelliedMonkey Translator"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "BelliedMonkey, LLC"
    email: belliedmonkey@gmail.com
abstract: >-
  A free, open-source bilingual translation extension for Safari (iPhone, iPad, Mac),
  Chrome and Firefox: web pages and video subtitles in two languages at once, with
  spaced-repetition review cards built from the sentences you actually read. Bring your
  own LLM API key; no server of the author's in the translation path.
version: 1.9.0
date-released: 2026-09-09
license: GPL-3.0
url: https://belliedmonkey.cc
repository-code: https://github.com/belliedmonkey/belliedmonkey-translator
keywords:
  - translation
  - bilingual
  - browser-extension
  - safari-extension
  - language-learning
  - spaced-repetition
